WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.950
Lab 1 runs on a laptop.

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.388
First, the kit's four
SailPoint client tests pass.

3
00:00:05.388 --> 00:00:09.675
Then list what the drift client needs
from SailPoint: a token, Search with

4
00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:13.963
the search read scope, and the Accounts
list with the accounts read scope.

5
00:00:13.963 --> 00:00:15.263
That's two scopes.

6
00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:18.200
Now give it a manage
scope as well and compare.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.046
Nothing is missing, the
manage scope is extra,

8
00:00:21.046 --> 00:00:25.200
least privilege doesn't hold, and
the command exits with a failure.

9
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.090
That one line is the
review an I S S O needs.
